    'Photos and documents use the shared `IFileStore` (Azure Blob): `doc.attachment` with owner type (SURVEY, SURVEY_DAMAGE, ESTIMATE_LINE, WORK_ORDER, CLEANING, PTI, INCIDENT), **photo angle** (FRONT, LEFT, RIGHT, REAR, ROOF, FLOOR, DOOR, UNDER, DATA_PLATE, DETAIL), stage (BEFORE, DURING, AFTER), SHA-256 hash, `taken_at`, optional GPS. Evidence photos are never physically deleted (hidden only), as in TOS.',
